    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a food delivery robot wheeling and dealing tasty treats to students across a vibrant college campus! Dodge angry pedestrians by navigating interconnected pathways, outmaneuver reckless drivers while locating waypoints on your map, and complete orders to create happy customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive around a college campus made of Brick and Ivy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver food orders to waypoints across campus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid angry pedestrians and dodge cars while crossing roads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete as many orders as possible without dying</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a food delivery robot wheeling and dealing tasty treats to students across a vibrant college campus! Dodge angry pedestrians by navigating interconnected pathways, outmaneuver reckless drivers while locating waypoints on your map, and complete orders to create happy customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive around a college campus made of Brick and Ivy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver food orders to waypoints across campus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid angry pedestrians and dodge cars while crossing roads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete as many orders as possible without dying</p></li></ul>",
